{"title":"I Really Don’t Want to Be Reborn","synopsis":"Sedikit yang saya tahu, saya Chen Hansheng; mantan elit masyarakat dan Sarjana Berlian, terlahir kembali. Ketika saya bangun, saya adalah lulusan senior di sekolah menengah.\n\nKemudian, Chen Hansheng sedang berjalan di dekat penyeberangan, dia tampak ragu-ragu. Seorang gadis yang berharga; Shen Youchu dan dua gadis lainnya; Bai Yueguang dan Xiao Rongyu, siapa yang akan dia pilih? Mereka semua? Salah satu diantara mereka? Dua dari mereka? Baca untuk mengetahuinya.\n\nCatatan Samping: Diamond Bachelor adalah kata slang yang berarti seseorang yang sangat kaya dan lajang.","alternative_title":"我真没想重生啊, I Really Don't Want to Remake, Ta Không Muốn Trùng Sinh Đâu","author":"Pikapi (噼咔噼)","artist":"Pikapi (噼咔噼)","genres":["Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"chapters":[{"id":"7d8a67d6-14e6-4379-940d-cf8e914e8b15","number":"477","title":"Chapter 477","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"d4af6d37-1290-451a-aba5-79f0f240a322","number":"476","title":"Chapter 476","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"a136de4c-fa35-451f-9c31-1062e56abb46","number":"475","title":"Chapter 475","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"3d8b7be7-5b4e-4ac8-86ef-9507e58906e1","number":"474","title":"Chapter 474","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"bfc56983-ef85-4589-b552-ce4254c4159e","number":"473","title":"Chapter 473","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"775da2f2-7d5f-4cbc-a1cf-1f2eebbe3d9e","number":"472","title":"Chapter 472","date":"2026-05-14","images":[]},{"id":"576a2ef4-cfe9-4664-b913-0c8f52c9b2e2","number":"471","title":"Chapter 471","date":"2026-05-08","images":[]},{"id":"1f66ef51-f915-435b-bf93-141489ee5fc9","number":"470","title":"Chapter 470","date":"2026-05-06","images":[]},{"id":"85589927-2668-41c0-bec6-ed990851cd84","number":"469","title":"Chapter 469","date":"2026-05-04","images":[]},{"id":"94240c73-7e41-4b16-b858-2687cda627ac","number":"468","title":"Chapter 468","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"id":"fcc2db83-36da-4462-9